 "words": 160,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "So I urge you by the mercies of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Offer your bodies as a living sacrifice",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy and pleasing to Him in spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is your true spiritual worship",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be conformed to this age",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be transformed by the renewing of your mind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you can discern His will",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is good and pleasing and perfect",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not think of yourself more highly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Than you are with sober judgment",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to the measure of faith",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God has assigned to each of us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be conformed to this age",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be transformed by the renewing of your mind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you can discern His will",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is good and pleasing and perfect",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as in one body we have many parts",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not all the parts have the same function",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We are one body in Christ",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each of us belongs to all the others",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be transformed by the renewing of your mind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
